!! Your job (pentabarf V: wave 1 counts as testimony, not truth)
# For each wave-1 finding: re-measure it against the code yourself. Confirm (quote file:line), refute (quote what wave 1 missed), or reshape. Mark any wave-1 claim you could not reproduce.
# For each finding that survives: name the remedy that keeps the ruling inside the house laws (No global now, no back-compat in early alpha, causal islands, identity-as-relation, Infrastructure-as-Myth), or show why no remedy exists and the ruling must change. Prefer a relation act (a set-aside, a kāpae, a re-anchor, a roll of the op key) over any counter or clock.
# Add anything wave 1 missed, especially drift where canon describes a mechanism the code lacks.
